gn="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Syk, Sky, GFRs</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">CD79A</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">P11912</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Y182/Y188</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">3.1</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.01</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Lyn</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">PAXI</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">P49023</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Y118</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">4.0</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.02</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">FAK, Src, Brk</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">PAXI</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">P49023</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Y31</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">4.3</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.03</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">FAK, Src, Brk</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t1-fn1"><label/><p>Tyrosine kinase substrate specificities are included.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>